  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Inclusion of Vulnerable Children with Disabilities Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The project development objective is two-fold namely: to (i) improve economic empowerment of households with disabled children and (ii) improve access to basic learning opportunities for the vulnerable disabled children in targeted schools in Djibouti.The following are the proposed key outcome indicators:  &#x2022;	Targeted disabled children with access to adapted learning materials from project support&#x2022;	Households with disabled children that are beneficiaries of productive inclusion interventions under the project (disaggregated         by age and gender)&#x2022;	Participants to the productive inclusion interventions that are engaged in self-employment or wage employment activities six         months after receiving support (disaggregated by age and gender)&#x2022;	Beneficiary disabled children and caretakers expressing satisfaction with project support services (Percentage)&#x2022;	Stakeholders (educators, parents and caretakers) reporting improved awareness about managing needs for children&#x2019;s        disabilities (percentage)  &quot;</narrative>
  </description>
